            "description": {
              "value": "Your hair unarmed attack gains the reach trait. You can deliver hexes through your hair.\n\nWhen you successfully cast a hex focus spell that requires 2 or more actions to cast and that doesn't require a spell attack roll, if your target is within your reach, as part of the spellcasting activity you can make a hair Strike against the foe before applying any effects of the hex. If this Strike misses, the hex has no effect."
